                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5747/13.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Squiers to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-04-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 9,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Squiers reports that the minister for foreign affairs approves the
                    suggestion and will instruct Minister Arango to take up the matter with the
                    department.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
